OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AEU announces plan to restrict social
OL,4,Amedia access for under-15s
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe European Commission said social
OL,7,Fmedia companies would need to prove
OL,8,Fplatforms were safe by design or face
OL,9,Ffines of up to 6% of their global
OL,10,Fsales. EU chief Ursula von der Leyen
OL,11,Fsaid the move would "put parents back
OL,12,Fin the driving seat".
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
